sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Redis as Redis Cache
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Worker as BullMQ Worker

    API->>DB: INSERT Envelope (Durable System of Record)
    API->>Redis: Publish routing event to active socket node
    Note over Redis: Redis restarts / crashes
    API-->>API: Socket routing drops
    Worker->>DB: Query pending undelivered envelopes from PostgreSQL
    Worker->>API: Re-trigger delivery fan-out from PostgreSQL state
